{
  "_note": [
    "NORMAL -- Easy's plan, played sooner and carried further (AI_Player_difficulty.md).",
    "",
    "THE FOUR OFFENSIVE LEVELS ARE DELIBERATELY THE SAME PATTERN, on the owner's",
    "instruction. Diffing this file against ai_easy.json should show only what the",
    "difficulty table says differs, and nothing else:",
    "",
    "  lag_ticks   20-60 -> 10-40   noticing sooner is most of what 'better' means",
    "  max_age     2 -> 3",
    "  attack      6000 ticks (10 min) -> 4200 (7 min)",
    "  towers      max 1 -> max 5",
    "  army        10 swordsmen -> 15, plus 6 archers once the range is up",
    "  houses      3 -> 5, because 15 + 6 + 9 villagers is 30 pop and a house is 5",
    "",
    "A SECOND advance_age RULE IS WHAT AGE 3 COSTS, and it is gated on an economy",
    "rather than on a clock: ageing with six villagers and no farm produces a bot that",
    "is technically in age 3 and cannot afford anything in it. `at_least` on villagers",
    "and a mill is the cheapest honest test of 'the economy can carry it'.",
    "",
    "THE ARCHERY RANGE IS THE ONE ADDITION THAT IS NOT A NUMBER. A second production",
    "building means the army is mixed rather than five of the same thing, which is what",
    "makes Normal feel different to play against rather than merely faster."
  ],

  "id": "normal",
  "lag_ticks": [10, 40],
  "max_age": 3,
  "attacks": true,
  "techs": true,

  "rules": [
    {"do": "gather", "kind": "food", "units": 2,
     "when": {"age_max": 1, "gathering_fewer_than": {"food": 2}}},
    {"do": "gather", "kind": "stone", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_max": 1, "gathering_fewer_than": {"stone": 1}}},
    {"do": "gather", "kind": "wood", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_max": 1, "gathering_fewer_than": {"wood": 1}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.house", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.house": 1}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.mining_camp", "near": "res.stone", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.mining_camp": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.lumber_camp", "near": "res.tree", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.lumber_camp": 1}}},

    {"do": "gather", "kind": "gold", "units": 1,
     "when": {"gathering_fewer_than": {"gold": 1}}},

    {"do": "advance_age",
     "when": {"age": 1, "at_least": {"unit.villager": 5}}},

    {"do": "train", "at": "building.town_center", "unit": "unit.villager", "count": 3,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"unit.villager": 9}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.mill", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_min": 2, "fewer_than": {"building.mill": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.field", "near": "building.mill", "units": 1,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.mill": 1}, "fewer_than": {"building.field": 2}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.house", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.house": 2}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.barracks", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.barracks": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.watch_tower", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.watch_tower": 2}}},

    {"do": "train", "at": "building.barracks", "unit": "unit.swordsman", "count": 4,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.barracks": 1}, "fewer_than": {"unit.swordsman": 4}}},

    {"do": "advance_age",
     "when": {"age": 2, "at_least": {"unit.villager": 8, "building.mill": 1}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.house", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.house": 5}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.archery_range", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_min": 3, "fewer_than": {"building.archery_range": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.watch_tower", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_min": 3, "fewer_than": {"building.watch_tower": 5}}},

    {"do": "train", "at": "building.barracks", "unit": "unit.swordsman", "count": 4,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.barracks": 1}, "fewer_than": {"unit.swordsman": 15}}},
    {"do": "train", "at": "building.archery_range", "unit": "unit.archer", "count": 4,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.archery_range": 1}, "fewer_than": {"unit.archer": 6}}},

    {"do": "attack", "units": "military",
     "when": {"after_ticks": 4200, "at_least": {"unit.swordsman": 4}}}
  ]
}
